Package: libjpeg-staticdev
Version: 1:3.0.0-r0
Description: Hardware accelerated JPEG compression/decompression library - Development files (Static Libraries)
 libjpeg-turbo is a derivative of libjpeg that uses SIMD instructions
 (MMX, SSE2, NEON) to accelerate baseline JPEG compression and
 decompression  This package contains static libraries for software
 development.
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: OE-Core Developers <openembedded-core@lists.openembedded.org>
License: BSD-3-Clause
Architecture: armv7a-vfp-neon
OE: libjpeg-turbo
Homepage: http://libjpeg-turbo.org/
Depends: libjpeg-dev (= 1:3.0.0-r0)
Provides: libjpeg-turbo-staticdev
Source: http://downloads.sourceforge.net/libjpeg-turbo/libjpeg-turbo-3.0.0.tar.gz
